Subject: [PATCH v1 0/1] power: supply: qcom_battmgr: charge_* properties on SM8350/SM8550
To: Sebastian Reichel <sre@kernel.org>
Cc: linux-arm-msm@vger.kernel.org,
    linux-pm@vger.kernel.org,
    linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org

On SM8350/SM8550 pmic_glink firmware the battery "unit" is never set,
so charge_full and charge_full_design always return -ENODATA and
UPower shows 0 Wh. This patch sets the unit to mAh for these variants
and exposes charge_now from the charge counter.

Tested on the Fairphone 6 (SM8550 variant). I could not test the
SM8350 fallback; reports from other SM8350/SM8550 devices are welcome.

Development was assisted by an AI coding tool (see the Assisted-by tag).

